1. Such permit will allow the mobile food truck or mobile food unit to remain parked in
a single parking place within downtown Cheyenne in excess of the signed two-hour
limitation;.

2. Applications for special purpose monthly on-street food truck parking permits shall be
submitted with the police department parking administration manager;.

