8.60.020 - Definitions.

A. The following definitions shall apply in the interpretation and enforcement of As used in
this chapter:

1. "Abate" or "abatement" means action taken to remove or alleviate a nuisance,
including, but not limited to, demolition, removal, repair, boarding or securing of
property;.
