3. Along or opposite any street excavation or obstruction when stopping, standing or
parking would obstruct traffic;. or

4. On any railroad tracks, nor within fifty (50) feet of any railroad crossing at grade.

B. Stand or park a vehicle or trailer, whether occupied or not:
